      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "In longer products or quotients, keep factors grouped and cancel only multiplicative factors. For √(50/2), simplify inside to √25=5. For √12/√3, the quotient rule gives √4=2. Verify by squaring or estimating the result.",
